## Animation Classes
```scss
@keyframes fadeInUp {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

@keyframes scaleIn {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.9);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
  }
}

.animate-fade-up {
  animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out forwards;
}

.animate-scale-in {
  animation: scaleIn 0.4s ease-out forwards;
}
```

