## Reference Standards
- **ALWAYS** use brand color palette exactly as specified
- **ALWAYS** incorporate brand visual elements with harmony
- **ALWAYS** maintain sharp, technical aesthetic
- **ALWAYS** use Code Bold for headings and CTAs
- **ALWAYS** use Coolvetica for body text
- **NEVER** use rounded corners (except where specified)
